AMENDEDANALYSIS
This bill revises residential care and health facility licensing requirements by (1) requiring
licensed residential care facilities to have quality assurance programs; (2) requiring the results of
investigationsandinspectionstobepostedonthedepartmentofhealthandhumanserviceswebsite;
(3) removing a redundant reference to administrative fines; (4) changing the term “hospital” to the
term “facility;” and (5) removing the word “continuing” from the initial education requirements and
replacingtheterm“ongoingtraining”withcontinuingeducationintheannualtrainingrequirement.

